{"id": "0900deab-c391-4673-9a29-8422f37ac524", "slug": "portfolio-hero", "title": "Portfolio Hero", "description": "Portfolio Avery Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Portfolio Hero\"\ndescription: \"Portfolio Avery Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FDE047\"\n  secondary: \"#080C0A\"\n  accent: \"#FEF08A\"\n  background: \"#FDE047\"\n  surface: \"#0C1912\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#87928C\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Portfolio Hero\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 14; favorites: 7; remixes: 0.\nTags: hero, section, animated, cta.\n## Overview\nPortfolio Avery Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nAvery Chen Product Designer ua en 01 < Hello, I design digital experiences > 02 < From idea to fully built products > 03 < No templates, only custom systems > 04 < Fast execution, clean structure > 05 < Built for scale…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nFollow the rendered preview for headline scale, supporting copy, navigation density, and component placement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FDE047, secondary #080C0A, accent #FEF08A, background #FDE047, surface #0C1912, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Portfolio Hero</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            dark: '#080c0a',\n                            panel: '#101613',\n                            accent: '#fde047',\n                            muted: '#87928c'\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-brand-dark text-white font-sans overflow-hidden h-screen w-full relative selection:bg-brand-accent selection:text-black\">\n\n    <!-- Background Environment -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/005600e5-f6ab-4e59-bc86-eaeb02797dfa_1600w.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; opacity: 0.15; filter: contrast(1.2) grayscale(0.5);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Dark/Green Overlays for Mood -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(12, 25, 18, 0.4) 0%, #080c0a 80%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #080c0a 0%, transparent 20%, transparent 80%, #080c0a 100%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Ambient Center Glow -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[80vw] max-w-3xl aspect-square z-0 pointer-events-none rounded-full\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(253, 224, 71, 0.03) 0%, transparent 60%); filter: blur(60px);\" id=\"ambient-glow\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Floating Particles Container -->\n    <div id=\"particles-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full p-6 md:p-10 flex justify-between items-start z-20\">\n        <!-- Avatar & Info -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group cursor-pointer\">\n            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-white/10\" style=\"background-image: url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/2f563338-39fa-47ea-9761-658d4f3f84db_1600w.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                <span class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-200 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\" style=\"transition-duration: 300ms;\">Avery Chen</span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-brand-muted\">Product Designer</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8\">\n            <!-- Language Switch -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-medium tracking-tight\">\n                <span class=\"text-brand-muted hover:text-gray-300 cursor-pointer transition-colors\" style=\"transition-duration: 300ms;\">ua</span>\n                <span class=\"text-white cursor-pointer\">en</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Social Icons -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center bg-white/5 border border-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/20 transition-all text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\" style=\"transition-duration: 300ms;\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:plain-linear\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center bg-white/5 border border-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/20 transition-all text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\" style=\"transition-duration: 300ms;\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:basketball-linear\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center bg-white/5 border border-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/20 transition-all text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\" style=\"transition-duration: 300ms;\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:case-linear\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4\" id=\"parallax-container\">\n\n        <!-- Terminal Panel -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-2xl bg-brand-panel/60 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-10 mb-8 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\">\n\n            <!-- Subtle internal glow -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% -20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0%, transparent 70%);\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 font-mono text-xs md:text-sm tracking-tight\" id=\"terminal-lines\">\n                <!-- Line 1 -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-400 terminal-line opacity-0\" style=\"transform: translateY(10px);\">\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50 min-w-[1.5rem]\">01</span>\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50\">&lt;</span>\n                    <div class=\"text-gray-300 flex flex-wrap gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 text-container\">\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">Hello,</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">I</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">design</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block text-brand-accent/90\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">digital</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block text-brand-accent/90\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">experiences</span></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50 ml-auto md:ml-0\">&gt;</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Line 2 -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-400 terminal-line opacity-0\" style=\"transform: translateY(10px);\">\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50 min-w-[1.5rem]\">02</span>\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50\">&lt;</span>\n                    <div class=\"text-gray-300 flex flex-wrap gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 text-container\">\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">From</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">idea</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">to</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block text-brand-accent/90\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">fully</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block text-brand-accent/90\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">built</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block text-brand-accent/90\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">products</span></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50 ml-auto md:ml-0\">&gt;</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Line 3 -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-400 terminal-line opacity-0\" style=\"transform: translateY(10px);\">\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50 min-w-[1.5rem]\">03</span>\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50\">&lt;</span>\n                    <div class=\"text-gray-300 flex flex-wrap gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 text-container\">\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">No</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">templates,</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">only</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">custom</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">systems</span></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50 ml-auto md:ml-0\">&gt;</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Line 4 -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-400 terminal-line opacity-0\" style=\"transform: translateY(10px);\">\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50 min-w-[1.5rem]\">04</span>\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50\">&lt;</span>\n                    <div class=\"text-gray-300 flex flex-wrap gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 text-container\">\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">Fast</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">execution,</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">clean</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">structure</span></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50 ml-auto md:ml-0\">&gt;</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Line 5 -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-400 terminal-line opacity-0\" style=\"transform: translateY(10px);\">\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50 min-w-[1.5rem]\">05</span>\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50\">&lt;</span>\n                    <div class=\"text-gray-300 flex flex-wrap gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 text-container\">\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">Built</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">for</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">scale</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">and</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">performance</span></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50 ml-auto md:ml-0\">&gt;</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Line 6 -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-brand-accent/80 terminal-line opacity-0\" style=\"transform: translateY(10px);\">\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50 min-w-[1.5rem]\">06</span>\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50\">&lt;</span>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 text-container items-center relative\">\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">Ready</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">to</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">launch</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">something</span></span>\n                        <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">new?</span></span>\n                        <div id=\"cursor\" class=\"w-2 h-4 bg-brand-accent ml-1 opacity-0\" style=\"transition: opacity 0.1s;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"opacity-50 ml-auto md:ml-0\">&gt;</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- CTAs -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-sm flex flex-col gap-4 cta-container opacity-0\" style=\"transform: translateY(20px);\">\n            <button class=\"w-full bg-brand-accent text-[#1a1a1a] font-medium tracking-tight text-sm py-4 px-6 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center gap-3 hover:bg-[#fef08a] transition-all relative overflow-hidden group shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(253,224,71,0.15)] hover:shadow-[0_0_32px_rgba(253,224,71,0.25)]\" style=\"transition-duration: 300ms;\">\n                <span class=\"relative z-10\">Start a Project</span>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"18\" class=\"relative z-10 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" style=\"transition-duration: 300ms;\"></iconify-icon>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/20 translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300 ease-out z-0 rounded-xl\" style=\"transition-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\"></div>\n            </button>\n\n            <button class=\"w-full bg-transparent border border-white/10 text-gray-300 font-medium tracking-tight text-sm py-4 px-6 rounded-xl hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white hover:border-white/20 transition-all\" style=\"transition-duration: 300ms;\">\n                Explore Work\n            </button>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n\n            // 1. Initial Timeline: Masked Staggered Word Reveal\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ delay: 0.2 });\n\n            const lines = document.querySelectorAll('.terminal-line');\n\n            lines.forEach((line, index) => {\n                const words = line.querySelectorAll('.word');\n\n                // Fade in the line container slightly\n                tl.to(line, {\n                    opacity: 1,\n                    y: 0,\n                    duration: 0.1,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\"\n                }, index * 0.3); // Stagger lines\n\n                // Masked reveal for words inside the line\n                if(words.length > 0) {\n                    tl.to(words, {\n                        y: \"0%\",\n                        duration: 0.4,\n                        stagger: 0.04,\n                        ease: \"power3.out\"\n                    }, \"<\"); // Start slightly after line appears\n                }\n            });\n\n            // 2. Reveal CTAs after terminal text\n            tl.to('.cta-container', {\n                opacity: 1,\n                y: 0,\n                duration: 0.6,\n                ease: \"power3.out\"\n            }, \"-=0.2\");\n\n            // 3. Blinking Cursor logic (starts after timeline completes)\n            tl.call(() => {\n                const cursor = document.getElementById('cursor');\n                let isVisible = false;\n                setInterval(() => {\n                    isVisible = !isVisible;\n                    cursor.style.opacity = isVisible ? '1' : '0';\n                }, 530);\n            });\n\n            // 4. Parallax & Particles (Vanilla JS implementation to avoid style tags)\n            const container = document.getElementById('parallax-container');\n            const ambientGlow = document.getElementById('ambient-glow');\n            const particlesContainer = document.getElementById('particles-container');\n\n            // Generate particles\n            const particleCount = 20;\n            const particles = [];\n\n            for(let i=0; i<particleCount; i++) {\n                const p = document.createElement('div');\n                p.className = 'absolute rounded-full pointer-events-none bg-brand-accent/20 blur-[1px]';\n\n                // Random properties\n                const size = Math.random() * 4 + 1;\n                const x = Math.random() * 100;\n                const y = Math.random() * 100;\n                const speedY = Math.random() * 0.3 + 0.1;\n                const opacity = Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.1;\n\n                p.style.width = `${size}px`;\n                p.style.height = `${size}px`;\n                p.style.left = `${x}vw`;\n                p.style.top = `${y}vh`;\n                p.style.opacity = opacity;\n\n                particlesContainer.appendChild(p);\n                particles.push({ element: p, y: y, speedY: speedY });\n            }\n\n            // Animation loop for particles and breathing glow\n            let time = 0;\n            function animate() {\n                time += 0.01;\n\n                // Move particles slowly up\n                particles.forEach(p => {\n                    p.y -= p.speedY;\n                    if(p.y < -10) p.y = 110; // reset to bottom\n                    p.element.style.top = `${p.y}vh`;\n                    // subtle horizontal drift\n                    p.element.style.transform = `translateX(${Math.sin(time + p.y) * 10}px)`;\n                });\n\n                // Breathing glow\n                const breathe = (Math.sin(time * 2) + 1) / 2; // 0 to 1\n                ambientGlow.style.opacity = 0.5 + (breathe * 0.5);\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            }\n            animate();\n\n            // Subtle mouse parallax\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const mouseX = e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5;\n                const mouseY = e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5;\n\n                gsap.to(container, {\n                    x: mouseX * -15,\n                    y: mouseY * -15,\n                    duration: 1,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\"\n                });\n\n                gsap.to(ambientGlow, {\n                    x: mouseX * -30,\n                    y: mouseY * -30,\n                    duration: 1.5,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\"\n                });\n\n                gsap.to(particlesContainer, {\n                    x: mouseX * -40,\n                    y: mouseY * -40,\n                    duration: 2,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\"\n                });\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "portfolio-hero.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/portfolio-hero.jpg", "source_name": "portfolio-hero-DESIGN.md", "views": 100, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T17:31:49.483508+00:00"}